    "r1172_hmgcoa_transport_close_evidence": "No GPR and no known carrier; no evidence found for HMG-CoA crossing the inner mitochondrial membrane in yeast (model/reports/w29_13c_consistency_20261012 section 5.4). S. cerevisiae ERG10 (UniProt P41338) is cytosolic by experiment; ERG13 (P54839) has no experimental mitochondrial location (GO mitochondrion NAS only). The cytosolic route R82 (YALI1B11532g) and R411 (YALI1F38116g) to HMGR R410 is kept.",
    "r1172_hmgcoa_transport_close_effect": "Stage 1 in memory (Task A medium + PO1f, Gurobi 1e-9): WT -0.305 % on 2f352037 (-0.207 % on e584151f); R82 and R411 become required; R412 then has no role in growth or gene calls; the YALI1F38116g and YALI1B11532g knockouts go to 0.",
    "r1172_hmgcoa_transport_close_limits": "Absence of found evidence, not evidence of absence: an uncharacterised carrier may exist. Yeast-GEM 9.0.2 (r_1840), iMM904 (HMGCOAtm) and iYali5 (1840) carry the same gene-less transport. The retention notes stay: the reaction is kept but closed. R412 (mitochondrial HMG-CoA synthase) is not changed. Chemistry unchanged.",
    "r1172_hmgcoa_transport_close_sources": "https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/P41338/entry; https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/P54839/entry; https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/Q6BZW0/entry; https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/Q6CFB6/entry",
    "r1172_hmgcoa_transport_close_authorization": "User reversed the 2026-09-09 retention for R1172 flux and authorized closing it to (0, 0), reaction kept, on 2026-11-12 after the Stage 1 report (model/reports/r1172_hmgcoa_transport_20261112/)."
